Dave,

With a big caveat that I have no experience with it, beta regression might be appropriate in your case. The beta distribution is confined to the 0 to 1 interval, so it's been used on concentrations before. As for the missing values below the detection limit problem, I have no suggestions. Good luck!

Calvin

